---
// Punchy tagline section
---

<section class="tagline-section py-16 relative z-10 -mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="tagline-container p-8 rounded-lg">
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-center font-light text-white leading-relaxed">
        I've designed and engineered systems that operate <span class="highlight">in the human body</span>, 
        <span class="highlight">30,000 feet in the air</span>, and across millions of phones, homes, and servers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tagline-section {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .tagline-container {
    background: rgba(164, 73, 206, 0.25);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(190, 156, 212, 0.3);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #ffa07a;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
